  The hack.font and hack/8 files need to be in the NetHack: directory.
Thus, you can't use a font editor to edit them directly (although it's not
difficult to move them to the fonts: directory and then back).

  Also, you should get NetHack 3.1.3 - the display has been greatly
improved (along with the other bug fixes, of course).  I have no problem
using a custom hack.font with 3.1.3.

